OL,3,AHouthis say they targeted Saudi capital
OL,4,Awith ballistic missiles
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir raid alerts had sounded in the
OL,7,Fcapital for the first time since the
OL,8,FIran-backed Houthis increased their
OL,9,Fattacks on Saudi Arabia in July.
